{"callerless":false,"callers":[{"excerpt":[{"line":869,"text":"const ACCOUNT_IMPORT_HELP=`Steam is a true one-click: Steam's own \"Sign in through Steam\", no key, no app registration — it comes straight back with your library connected. Epic, EA and Battle.net pull your owned library through the same web APIs Playnite uses — none of them issues an application key, so each opens the page your signed-in browser already has and takes one paste. GOG needs only your public profile name.`;"},{"line":870,"text":"const GGR_WEBHOOK_HELP=`Restart GG Requestz after changing its environment. In GG Requestz 1.5+, the webhook fires when a request becomes approved; enable request.auto_approve or approve it manually. A successful delivery now receives HTTP 202. Rejected payloads receive HTTP 422 and are named in both applications' logs.`;"},{"line":871,"text":"const ROMM_FRIEND_HELP=`Your friend does not need to run ROMarr. If they use RomM, ask them for an account and choose Add a RomM server. RomM publishes a hash for every ROM, so browsing and netplay matching work without installing anything on their server. The account gets the access their RomM grants; ROMarr cannot narrow it.`;"},{"line":872,"text":"const NETPLAY_HELP=`Netplay matches each ROM by its SHA1, not by its title. “Super Mario Kart” can refer to four different ROMs; two incorrect matches may desync within seconds and look like lag. ROMarr can match only games whose hashes it knows.`;"},{"line":873,"text":"const NO_HASHES_HELP=`No hashes have been recorded yet, so all netplay offers will show as missing. ROMarr reads each ROM's SHA1 from the library server automatically.`;"},{"line":874,"text":"const GG_ADDRESS_HELP=`Use {url} on the same Docker network. Otherwise use ROMarr's LAN or HTTPS URL, reachable from GG Requestz.`;"},{"line":875,"text":"const ROM_SITE_HELP=`ROM sites use plain HTTP through the Direct HTTP client. Some sites require a form that their own page submits, so those need the Headless Browser client to load the page and submit the form. Sites that require a CAPTCHA or bot-detection challenge are reported as unavailable instead of being bypassed.`;"}],"excerptSha256":"b7f6ca125c5c609c054a649af19744061a165006ffcc1cf704ef0efaa63cb4eb","fileSha256":"4a3257389dd4c9ba3d2d473ad95511bc9fdf4b914a5b88216f9a4b698e65c40b","gitBlob":"97b1b1806695eed434ab9c814838dc10edf0f8c0","line":872,"lineSha256":"9d7d3988503304d0d76b5361cf6238916c2bd37c46445b6c4bbe519c788149e7","lineText":"const NETPLAY_HELP=`Netplay matches each ROM by its SHA1, not by its title. “Super Mario Kart” can refer to four different ROMs; two incorrect matches may desync within seconds and look like lag. ROMarr can match only games whose hashes it knows.`;","matchKind":"exact quoted source literal","path":"romarr/ui.py"}],"contextSha256":"5ae66f1ae9f9c4e2e35d4fbfa4e0f11b952c643ac8104f7ffe831173b9993b87","exactMatchCount":1,"head":"8b7589775c526866e474112b4f4168782b02f881","productionFilesSearched":51,"searchMethod":"exact quoted source literal, exact source ID, or exact HTML text-node search in tracked production code under romarr; tests, docs, catalogs, and workflows excluded","source":"Netplay matches each ROM by its SHA1, not by its title. “Super Mario Kart” can refer to four different ROMs; two incorrect matches may desync within seconds and look like lag. ROMarr can match only games whose hashes it knows.","sourceId":"ui.netplay-matches-each-rom-by-its-sha1.b7c6f7d73a","sourceSha256":"b7c6f7d73a639523398f07d20166241deae1a9fbb2668f02f1fef157955a4688"}
